    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d416-a2-a4">

                <pb facs="0739" n="669" sameAs="frus:frus1883/pg669"/>

                <p>Francisco G. Grinda, collector of customs, affirmed, states that what Mr. Isais
                    stated in his deposition is true, as appears from the statement to which said
                    officer refers, presented to the judge in one leaf, written in English. He also
                    states that the signatures of said statement are in the .handwriting of said
                    captain.</p>
                <closer><signed>FRANCISCO G. GRINDA</signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
